    file - the stock "spring" generator has no integration-test template at all. Registered as
    a per-tag "api template file" via CodegenConfig#apiTemplateFiles() in the generation driver
    code (see AllcrudGenerator), with output suffix "ControllerIT.java".

    Extends the core's CrudControllerIntegrationTests base (com.techmath.allcrud.controller,
    confirmed via javap against the allcrud test-fixtures jar, not guessed) - uses its 3-arg
    constructor (Class VO, Class ID, Class controller), which resolves the base path
    automatically via reflection over the controller's @RequestMapping - no config needed here
    for that. The base class' mockMvc field is already @Autowired there, and its
    configureDataSource method (static, @DynamicPropertySource) is inherited and picked up
    automatically by Spring's TestContext framework once this subclass IS a genuine Spring
    test - but the base carries no class-level @SpringBootTest/@AutoConfigureMockMvc (also
    confirmed via javap), so both have to be declared here.

    allcrudEntityName / allcrudIdType / allcrudEntityPackage / allcrudPojoPackage /
    allcrudPojoClassName / allcrudRepositoryPackage / allcrudConverterPackage /
    allcrudControllerPackage are resolved per-resource by AllcrudSpringCodegen - see that class.
    INTEGRATION_TEST has no allcrudIntegrationTestPackage of its own to resolve for cross-file
    imports: nothing else ever imports "the integration test" class. This is a per-resource
    artifact placed under GenerationRequest#testSourceRoot (never sourceRoot), always "generate
    once, never overwrite" - no onRegenerate knob, same as every non-POJO layer.

    Depends at RUNTIME (not generation time) on the global exception handler
    (ExceptionHandlerConfig) being present in the Spring context for HTTP status codes to match
    what this base class' @Test methods expect (EntityNotFoundException -> 404, etc) - this is
    not validated by the generator, it's a documentation note for whoever wires this project up:
    if exceptionHandler.generate is false, these tests will fail against real behavior, not
    against a generator bug. }}
